%% Request sequence — happy path
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A as ContextAssembler
  participant M as MemoryStores
  participant L as LLM_Tools
  C->>G: Authenticated request
  G->>O: Start or resume thread
  O->>A: Assemble context
  A->>M: Retrieve STM semantic procedural episodic
  M-->>A: Hits and manifests
  A-->>O: ContextPackage
  O->>L: Model and tool step
  L-->>O: Results
  O->>O: Checkpoint save
  O-->>C: Progress or interrupt
